muemacs (3.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Search engine swapped onto sublimation, montauk's adaptive sort and
    search core (literal + regex faces; one engine behind every search
    command).
  * UEP extension API v4: public vim state typedefs, input:raw
    pre-dispatch event, register and undo-boundary primitives, OSC 52
    clipboard bridge.
  * Vim/Evil modal editing provided by the c_evil extension.
  * Linus-first defaults shipped (column_width=72, classic modeline).
  * UTF-8 multi-byte insert truncation fixed; M-q hybrid soft/hard wrap.
  * Event-loop regression fixed (edge-triggered epoll, false EOF in
    raw_getchar).
  * TOML configuration with XDG Base Directory support.
  * C23 codebase, TrueColor display, built-in terminal emulator.

 -- Will Clingan <wuz352@hotmail.com>  Tue, 21 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
